Filling.; Oppletura.

@AC 2121[2]. These Worlds of Spirits are very full...

@7442[4]. The Sensuous... is filled with material ideas...

@9863. "Thou shalt fill it with a filling of stone" (Exodus 28:17) = truths themselves in their order from one good. Explained.

@9874. "They shall be enclosed in gold in their fillings" (Exodus 28:20) = that each and all things in general and in particular must proceed from the good which is of love from the Lord to the Lord. Explained.

